@* Project-root _ViewImports: Razor discovers _ViewImports/_ViewStart by walking UP
   the physical directory tree from each view. Feature views live under Features/,
   so these two files must sit at the project root to apply to every slice. The
   shared _Layout itself lives in Common/Views/Shared/ and is resolved via the
   FeatureViewLocationExpander, exactly as specified. *@
@using MaceHub.Web
@using MaceHub.Web.Features.Example
@addTagHelper *, Microsoft.AspNetCore.Mvc.TagHelpers
